  "title": "HyperSVG 2.0 drawing rules",
  "description": "The closed SVG subset (2.11), the marks (6.1), the mark tiers, the id grammar (2.12) and the limits, for drawing-check.mjs. Drawings are XML, so these rules are not JSON Schema.",
